                                "sense_id": "406e044e-fdeb-3b74-b2ca-27941059beab",
                                "text": "[T]he poſture of the Confeſſant and the Prieſt in Confeſsion: which is, that the Confeſſant kneeles downe before the Prieſt ſitting in a raiſed chaire aboue him."
