                                "sense_id": "406e044e-fdeb-3b74-b2ca-27941059beab",
                                "text": "In 2013, though, the New Hampshire Supreme Court ruled that clergy were required to report abuse because confessants \"cannot have an objectively reasonable expectation that such a statement will remain confidential.\""
                            }
